  {
   "beat_id": "B02",
   "act": "EVIDENCE-IN-NOTES",
   "narration_text": "The evidence-in-notes column is the structural fix. For every action item in the output, Cowork must cite the exact phrase from the source notes that produced it. 'Exact phrase from source required for every item' is not a style preference — it forces Cowork to anchor synthesis to evidence, not to create plausible continuations of the discussion. If the phrase does not exist in the notes, the item cannot appear as decided.",
   "shot": {
    "type": "REMOTION",
    "source": "own",
    "motion": "callout-reveal",
    "media": "media/B02.mp4",
    "manim": {
     "scene_class": "Scene_B02_ClaudeLiamSynthesis",
     "scenes_file": "scenes_std.py",
     "rendered": {
      "out": "media/B02.mp4",
      "at": "2026-07-25T10:44:20.089695"
     }
    }
   },
   "new_visual_element": "Evidence in notes — exact phrase required / anchors synthesis to source / no phrase = not decided / column in table",
   "spark_line": "Exact phrase from source. Every item.",
   "estimated_duration_s": 13,
   "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
   "actual_duration_s": 22.42,
   "build": {
    "status": "SLATE",
    "src": null,
    "filled_by": null,
    "at": "2026-07-16T06:58:04",
    "needs": "PIPELINE → fill_slates/remotion_scenes for B02"
   }
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B03",
   "act": "MARK-UNCERTAIN",
   "narration_text": "Two rules for items without a clear owner or status: owner not stated goes to Unresolved, not assigned. Tabled items go to Tabled with the tabled-by phrase, not Decided. 'Mark uncertain — do not infer' is the instruction. Cowork's default is coherence. Your brief must override that default with a specific instruction to leave gaps visible rather than filling them with a plausible assignment.",
   "shot": {
    "type": "REMOTION",
    "source": "own",
    "motion": "callout-reveal",
    "media": "media/B03.mp4",
    "manim": {
     "scene_class": "Scene_B03_ClaudeLiamSynthesis",
     "scenes_file": "scenes_std.py",
     "rendered": {
      "out": "media/B03.mp4",
      "at": "2026-07-25T10:44:23.654726"
     }
    }
   },
   "new_visual_element": "Mark uncertain — no owner → Unresolved / tabled → Tabled / do not infer / override coherence default",
   "spark_line": "Unresolved, not assigned.",
   "estimated_duration_s": 13,
   "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
   "actual_duration_s": 21.06,
   "build": {
    "status": "SLATE",
    "src": null,
    "filled_by": null,
    "at": "2026-07-16T06:58:04",
    "needs": "PIPELINE → fill_slates/remotion_scenes for B03"
   }
  },
  {
   "beat_id": "B04",
   "act": "VERDICT",
   "narration_text": "The human-confirmed column is filled by you after reading the original notes — not by Cowork. Cowork outputs a draft. You read the source. You mark which items you can confirm from your direct knowledge of the meeting. Items you cannot confirm go back to Unresolved until a participant confirms them. That column is the gate between Cowork's synthesis and an authoritative record.",
   "shot": {
    "type": "REMOTION",
    "source": "own",
    "motion": "stagger",
    "remotion": {
     "pattern": "CoworkTaskView",
     "props": {
      "blocks": [
       {
        "type": "prompt",
        "text": "Fill Human Confirmed column after reading original notes"
       },
       {
        "type": "review",
        "items": [
         {
          "title": "Cowork outputs a DRAFT — not a record",
          "badge": "Rule",
          "badgeTone": "warn"
         },
         {
          "title": "You read the source notes and confirm",
          "badge": "Your job",
          "badgeTone": "pass"
         },
         {
          "title": "Cannot confirm → goes back to Unresolved",
          "badge": "Rule",
          "badgeTone": "neutral"
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "cues": [
       0,
       18,
       34
      ]
     },
     "rendered": {
      "out": "media/B04.mp4",
      "at": ""
     }
    }
